"""
Private Configuration Module - EXAMPLE FILE

This is an example file. Copy it to create your actual private.py:
    cp private.py.example private.py

Then edit private.py and add your actual Discord bot token.

⚠️  SECURITY WARNING: Never commit private.py to git! It's in .gitignore.

Setup Instructions:
1. Copy this file: cp private.py.example private.py
2. Go to https://discord.com/developers/applications
3. Select your bot application
4. Go to "Bot" section
5. Click "Reset Token" and copy the new token
6. Edit private.py and replace 'YOUR_DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN_HERE' with your actual token
7. Save the file

Example token format: MTIzNDU2Nzg5MDEyMzQ1Njc4OQ.GaBcDe.FgHiJkLmNoPqRsTuVwXyZ
"""

# Discord Bot Token
# REPLACE THIS WITH YOUR ACTUAL BOT TOKEN FROM DISCORD DEVELOPER PORTAL
